use os;
use uo;

// The core starts this when a client asks for a character profile, or writes one back. It is
// handed the character that asked, the mobile the request is about, which of the two it was, and
// the new text of an update. Everything it knows is answered to the asking character, which is
// how a test sees the request arrived and what it carried.

program charprofile( who, mobile, mode, text )
  SendSysMessage( who, $"charprofile [{mode}] [0x{mobile.serial:x}] [{text}]" );
endprogram
